            "Path: ./images_dataSAT/class_1_agri/dummy_agri_3.jpg, Label: 1\n",
            "\n",
            "Batch images shape: (8, 128, 128, 3)\n",
            "Batch labels: [1 1 0 0 1 0 1 0]\n",
            "\n",
            "Validation batch shape: (2, 128, 128, 3)\n",
            "Validation batch labels: [0 0]\n"
          ]
